{
  "borough": "Harrow",
  "application_type": "All Other",
  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;div style=&quot;padding: 0.75pt;&quot;&gt;The proposed development, by reason of the excessive number of occupiers that it accommodates and poor outlook from Rooms 3 and 7, represents an overly intensive use of the site which would result in substandard living accommodation for existing and future occupiers of the site, and would be likely to give rise to undue levels of disturbance and noise resulting in a detrimental impact on the amenities of future occupiers and adjoining properties.&amp;nbsp; Furthermore, the proposal is unacceptable in principle due to the site’s poor accessibility to public transport and essential services.&amp;nbsp;The proposal is therefore contrary to the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), policies D3.D(7), D3.D(9), and D3.D(10) and D14 of The London Plan (2021), policies DM1, DM26 and DM30 of the Development Management Policies (2013) and&amp;nbsp;Policy HO10 of Harrow’s New Draft Local Plan 2021-2041 (Regulation 19 Version) (2025).&lt;/div&gt;"
  ],
